<h2>Teaching and academic service</h2>
<p>
  I have been a Graduate Teaching Assistant at King’s College London since November 2023, teaching undergraduate mathematics and medical imaging.
  At IEEE NSS/MIC 2026, I co-taught <a href="https://nssmic.ieee.org/2026/program/">Medical Image Reconstruction: from Foundations to AI</a>
  with Andrew Reader and Siqi Li, and co-chaired <a href="https://ieee2026.eventclass.it/scientific/online-program/session?s=MIC-18">Advanced Tomographic Reconstruction Techniques (2)</a>
  with Jinyi Qi on 14 November.
</p>
<p>
  I have reviewed for ICLR, Nature Communications, Medical Image Analysis, IEEE Transactions on Medical Imaging,
  IEEE Transactions on Computational Imaging and Pattern Recognition.
</p>
